<title>USA: Time Warner confirms death of Chairman Levin's son.</title>
<headline>Time Warner confirms death of Chairman Levin's son.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Time Warner Inc. on Tuesday confirmed the death of Chairman Gerald Levin's son, Jonathan, whom police say may have been murdered.</p>
<p>In a press statement issued by Time Warner, President Richard Parsons said, &quot;We are shocked and saddened by the death of Jonathan Levin.&quot;</p>
</text>
